<roster id="vh5h6yg" name="fs-001-all-units" battleScribeVersion="2.03" generatedBy="https://newrecruit.eu" gameSystemId="e51d-b1a3-75fc-dc3g" gameSystemName="Age of Sigmar 4.0" gameSystemRevision="98" xmlns="http://www.battlescribe.net/schema/rosterSchema"><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="3100" /></costs><costLimits><costLimit name="pts" typeId="points" value="0" /></costLimits><forces><force id="w015qlq" name="✦ General's Handbook 2026-27" entryId="0151-9c5b-2f1e-32d4" catalogueId="b3f9-6c96-b99a-1e71" catalogueRevision="29" catalogueName="Fyreslayers"><selections><selection id="oue1phg" name="Allow Legends" entryId="7e59-2237-4890-a80a" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><categories><category id="676-2b78-7bbf-ba9c" entryId="676-2b78-7bbf-ba9c" name="Configuration" primary="true" /></categories></selection><selection id="p0f6zdb" name="Battle Traits: Fyreslayers" entryId="6dd6-eae-e685-f2f7::d272-b44a-2b04-4f2b" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="6495-107d-c4a5-684a" name="Rune of Fiery Determination" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Battle (Army), Any Hero Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">You can only use this ability if you have not used any **^^Ur-gold Rune^^** abilities this battle round.
Friendly **^^Fyreslayers^^** units have **^^Ward (5+)^^** for the rest of the battle round.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f">**^^Ur-gold Rune^^**</characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="6136-b2ec-a188-c7f" name="Rune of Farsight" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Battle (Army), Your Shooting Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">You can only use this ability if you have not used any **^^Ur-gold Rune^^** abilities this battle round.
Pick any number of enemy units within 10&quot; of any visible friendly **^^Fyreslayers^^** units to be targets.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Roll a D3 for each target. On a 2+, inflict an amount of mortal damage on the target equal to the roll. In addition,
for the rest of the battle round, ranged weapons, including Companion weapons, used by friendly **^^Fyreslayers^^** units have **Crit (2 Hits)**.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f">**^^Ur-gold Rune^^**</characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Blue</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Shooting</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="bd04-6f4-4d62-836e" name="Rune of Relentless Zeal" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Battle (Army), Your Movement Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">You can only use this ability if you have not used any **^^Ur-gold Rune^^** abilities this battle round.
For the rest of the battle round, friendly **^^Fyreslayers^^** units can use **^^Charge^^** abilities even if they used a **^^Run^^** ability in the same turn.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f">**^^Ur-gold Rune^^**</characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Gray</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Movement</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="72cd-53f5-e1b1-1e2a" name="Rune of Searing Heat" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Battle (Army), Any Combat Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">You can only use this ability if you have not used any **^^Ur-gold Rune^^** abilities this battle round.
Melee weapons used by friendly **^^Fyreslayers^^** units have **Crit (Mortal)** for the rest of the battle round.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f">**^^Ur-gold Rune^^**</characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Red</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Offensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="59a2-a95c-9d9b-fa8c" name="Rune of Fury" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Battle (Army), Start of Any Turn</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">You can only use this ability if you have not used any **^^Ur-gold Rune^^** abilities this battle round.
For the rest of the battle round, friendly **^^Fyreslayers^^** units have **^^Strike-first^^** while they are in combat with an enemy unit that charged in the same turn.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f">**^^Ur-gold Rune^^**</characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Offensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile></profiles><categories><category id="3360-1158-e879-9606" entryId="3360-1158-e879-9606" name="Reference" primary="true" /></categories></selection><selection id="xvochds" name="Battle Formation" entryId="7ab5-242f-d20a-3a20" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><categories><category id="ac97-b27c-7e35-7ab9" entryId="ac97-b27c-7e35-7ab9" name="Army Composition" primary="true" /></categories></selection><selection id="p5km5zi" name="Battle Formation" entryId="7ab5-242f-d20a-3a20" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><categories><category id="ac97-b27c-7e35-7ab9" entryId="ac97-b27c-7e35-7ab9" name="Army Composition" primary="true" /></categories></selection><selection id="xzhyfdd" name="Battle Tactic Cards" entryId="1668-6989-2470-5e10" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><categories><category id="ac97-b27c-7e35-7ab9" entryId="ac97-b27c-7e35-7ab9" name="Army Composition" primary="true" /></categories></selection><selection id="pboe9t8" name="Battle Tactic Cards" entryId="1668-6989-2470-5e10" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><categories><category id="ac97-b27c-7e35-7ab9" entryId="ac97-b27c-7e35-7ab9" name="Army Composition" primary="true" /></categories></selection><selection id="y2zp16w" name="Manifestation Lore" entryId="5a57-9133-dc52-ee88" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><categories><category id="ac97-b27c-7e35-7ab9" entryId="ac97-b27c-7e35-7ab9" name="Army Composition" primary="true" /></categories></selection><selection id="ph5xqsv" name="Manifestation Lore" entryId="5a57-9133-dc52-ee88" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><categories><category id="ac97-b27c-7e35-7ab9" entryId="ac97-b27c-7e35-7ab9" name="Army Composition" primary="true" /></categories></selection><selection id="y5obvxs" name="Prayer Lore" entryId="268c-558a-7571-8013" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><selections><selection id="y6ud4g4" name="Zharrgrim Blessings" entryId="93d0-95e8-b87d-3660::3b2b-a46b-82b5-a3e7" entryGroupId="93d0-95e8-b87d-3660::512c-e67c-9673-826" number="1" type="upgrade" from="group" group="Prayer Lores"><selections><selection id="y7mdbc" name="Prayer of Ash" entryId="93d0-95e8-b87d-3660::0939-7a8d-2312-923c::0309-15ef-31c7-b287" entryGroupId="93d0-95e8-b87d-3660::0939-7a8d-2312-923c::82ee-bf3d-bf8f-a0c0" number="1" type="upgrade" from="group" group="Zharrgrim Blessings"><profiles><profile id="9e1e-fc0-553-ccab" name="Prayer of Ash" hidden="false" typeId="5946-234-d7b4-6195" typeName="Ability (Prayer)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="76bf-8126-64d4-c709">Your Hero Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Chanting Value" typeId="f192-6780-8138-9cef">4</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="284c-90b2-245b-adf3">Pick a friendly **^^Fyreslayers Priest^^** to chant this prayer, pick a visible friendly **^^Fyreslayers^^** unit wholly within 12&quot; of them to be the target, then make a chanting roll of D6.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="6219-6fcc-5ae2-a6b7">Subtract 1 from wound rolls for attacks that target that friendly unit until the start of your next turn.
If the chanting roll was 8+, also subtract 1 from the Rend characteristic of attacks that target that friendly unit until the start of your next turn.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="e3d8-f58b-e4e0-8e9d">**^^Prayer^^**, **^^Unlimited^^**</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="7564-4bf0-b34a-b143">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="c63c-196d-34a7-cec3">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="5d25-63d6-3935-9312" /></attributes></profile></profiles></selection><selection id="y85yadg" name="Prayer of Grimnir's Fury" entryId="93d0-95e8-b87d-3660::0939-7a8d-2312-923c::e204-0c0b-2395-dd81" entryGroupId="93d0-95e8-b87d-3660::0939-7a8d-2312-923c::82ee-bf3d-bf8f-a0c0" number="1" type="upgrade" from="group" group="Zharrgrim Blessings"><profiles><profile id="9f97-127b-8728-2c9a" name="Prayer of Grimnir's Fury" hidden="false" typeId="5946-234-d7b4-6195" typeName="Ability (Prayer)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="76bf-8126-64d4-c709">Your Hero Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Chanting Value" typeId="f192-6780-8138-9cef">4</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="284c-90b2-245b-adf3">Pick a friendly **^^Fyreslayers Priest^^** to chant this prayer, pick a visible friendly **^^Fyreslayers Infantry Hero^^** wholly within 12&quot; of them to be the target, then make a chanting roll of D6.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="6219-6fcc-5ae2-a6b7">The target can use 2 **^^Fight^^** abilities this turn. After the first is used, however, the target has **^^Strike-last^^** for the rest of the turn.
If the chanting roll was 8+, also add 1 to wound rolls for the target's combat attacks for the rest of the turn.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="e3d8-f58b-e4e0-8e9d">**^^Prayer^^**</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="7564-4bf0-b34a-b143">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="c63c-196d-34a7-cec3">Offensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="5d25-63d6-3935-9312" /></attributes></profile></profiles></selection><selection id="y8uzwct" name="Wrath of Vulcatrix" entryId="93d0-95e8-b87d-3660::0939-7a8d-2312-923c::df73-605f-1bd1-620d" entryGroupId="93d0-95e8-b87d-3660::0939-7a8d-2312-923c::82ee-bf3d-bf8f-a0c0" number="1" type="upgrade" from="group" group="Zharrgrim Blessings"><profiles><profile id="cccf-b44c-6ff6-3e0" name="Wrath of Vulcatrix" hidden="false" typeId="5946-234-d7b4-6195" typeName="Ability (Prayer)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="76bf-8126-64d4-c709">Your Hero Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Chanting Value" typeId="f192-6780-8138-9cef">4</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="284c-90b2-245b-adf3">Pick a friendly **^^Fyreslayers Priest^^** to chant this prayer, pick a visible friendly **^^Magmadroth^^** unit wholly within 12&quot; of them to be the target, then make a chanting roll of D6.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="6219-6fcc-5ae2-a6b7">For the rest of the turn, the 'Battle Damaged' ability has no effect on the target and add 1 to the Attacks characteristic of the target's **Companion** weapons.
If the chanting roll was 8+, add 1 to the Attacks characteristic of the target's **Companion** weapons for every 4 damage points the target has instead.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="e3d8-f58b-e4e0-8e9d">**^^Prayer^^**</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="7564-4bf0-b34a-b143">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="c63c-196d-34a7-cec3">Offensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="5d25-63d6-3935-9312" /></attributes></profile></profiles></selection></selections></selection></selections><categories><category id="ac97-b27c-7e35-7ab9" entryId="ac97-b27c-7e35-7ab9" name="Army Composition" primary="true" /></categories></selection><selection id="ptg1g3o" name="Prayer Lore" entryId="268c-558a-7571-8013" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><selections><selection id="pt5d8yk" name="Zharrgrim Blessings" entryId="93d0-95e8-b87d-3660::3b2b-a46b-82b5-a3e7" entryGroupId="93d0-95e8-b87d-3660::512c-e67c-9673-826" number="1" type="upgrade" from="group" group="Prayer Lores"><selections><selection id="pvwsg07" name="Prayer of Ash" entryId="93d0-95e8-b87d-3660::0939-7a8d-2312-923c::0309-15ef-31c7-b287" entryGroupId="93d0-95e8-b87d-3660::0939-7a8d-2312-923c::82ee-bf3d-bf8f-a0c0" number="1" type="upgrade" from="group" group="Zharrgrim Blessings"><profiles><profile id="9e1e-fc0-553-ccab" name="Prayer of Ash" hidden="false" typeId="5946-234-d7b4-6195" typeName="Ability (Prayer)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="76bf-8126-64d4-c709">Your Hero Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Chanting Value" typeId="f192-6780-8138-9cef">4</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="284c-90b2-245b-adf3">Pick a friendly **^^Fyreslayers Priest^^** to chant this prayer, pick a visible friendly **^^Fyreslayers^^** unit wholly within 12&quot; of them to be the target, then make a chanting roll of D6.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="6219-6fcc-5ae2-a6b7">Subtract 1 from wound rolls for attacks that target that friendly unit until the start of your next turn.
If the chanting roll was 8+, also subtract 1 from the Rend characteristic of attacks that target that friendly unit until the start of your next turn.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="e3d8-f58b-e4e0-8e9d">**^^Prayer^^**, **^^Unlimited^^**</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="7564-4bf0-b34a-b143">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="c63c-196d-34a7-cec3">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="5d25-63d6-3935-9312" /></attributes></profile></profiles></selection><selection id="pvi9pq" name="Prayer of Grimnir's Fury" entryId="93d0-95e8-b87d-3660::0939-7a8d-2312-923c::e204-0c0b-2395-dd81" entryGroupId="93d0-95e8-b87d-3660::0939-7a8d-2312-923c::82ee-bf3d-bf8f-a0c0" number="1" type="upgrade" from="group" group="Zharrgrim Blessings"><profiles><profile id="9f97-127b-8728-2c9a" name="Prayer of Grimnir's Fury" hidden="false" typeId="5946-234-d7b4-6195" typeName="Ability (Prayer)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="76bf-8126-64d4-c709">Your Hero Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Chanting Value" typeId="f192-6780-8138-9cef">4</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="284c-90b2-245b-adf3">Pick a friendly **^^Fyreslayers Priest^^** to chant this prayer, pick a visible friendly **^^Fyreslayers Infantry Hero^^** wholly within 12&quot; of them to be the target, then make a chanting roll of D6.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="6219-6fcc-5ae2-a6b7">The target can use 2 **^^Fight^^** abilities this turn. After the first is used, however, the target has **^^Strike-last^^** for the rest of the turn.
If the chanting roll was 8+, also add 1 to wound rolls for the target's combat attacks for the rest of the turn.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="e3d8-f58b-e4e0-8e9d">**^^Prayer^^**</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="7564-4bf0-b34a-b143">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="c63c-196d-34a7-cec3">Offensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="5d25-63d6-3935-9312" /></attributes></profile></profiles></selection><selection id="pvo85ua" name="Wrath of Vulcatrix" entryId="93d0-95e8-b87d-3660::0939-7a8d-2312-923c::df73-605f-1bd1-620d" entryGroupId="93d0-95e8-b87d-3660::0939-7a8d-2312-923c::82ee-bf3d-bf8f-a0c0" number="1" type="upgrade" from="group" group="Zharrgrim Blessings"><profiles><profile id="cccf-b44c-6ff6-3e0" name="Wrath of Vulcatrix" hidden="false" typeId="5946-234-d7b4-6195" typeName="Ability (Prayer)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="76bf-8126-64d4-c709">Your Hero Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Chanting Value" typeId="f192-6780-8138-9cef">4</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="284c-90b2-245b-adf3">Pick a friendly **^^Fyreslayers Priest^^** to chant this prayer, pick a visible friendly **^^Magmadroth^^** unit wholly within 12&quot; of them to be the target, then make a chanting roll of D6.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="6219-6fcc-5ae2-a6b7">For the rest of the turn, the 'Battle Damaged' ability has no effect on the target and add 1 to the Attacks characteristic of the target's **Companion** weapons.
If the chanting roll was 8+, add 1 to the Attacks characteristic of the target's **Companion** weapons for every 4 damage points the target has instead.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="e3d8-f58b-e4e0-8e9d">**^^Prayer^^**</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="7564-4bf0-b34a-b143">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="c63c-196d-34a7-cec3">Offensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="5d25-63d6-3935-9312" /></attributes></profile></profiles></selection></selections></selection></selections><categories><category id="ac97-b27c-7e35-7ab9" entryId="ac97-b27c-7e35-7ab9" name="Army Composition" primary="true" /></categories></selection><selection id="q5vt3x4" name="Magmic Battleforge" entryId="6278-ada9-3ced-2832::d4be-ace4-55bc-ea7c" number="1" type="unit" from="entry"><rules><rule id="c739-d1e5-c101-d1d4" name="Magmic Battleforge" hidden="false"><description>**The following universal terrain abilities apply to this terrain feature (Terrain, 1.2):
Cover, Impassable, Obscuring**</description></rule></rules><profiles><profile id="f8aa-afc7-d193-56bf" name="Magmic Battleforge" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">-</characteristic><characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">8</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">-</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="de34-a514-4ce6-3cac" name="Spending the Forge" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Battle (Army), Your Hero Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick a friendly **^^Fyreslayers Priest^^** within this terrain feature's combat range to expend the power of the forge.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">**Heal (D3)** each friendly **^^Fyreslayers^^** unit on the battlefield. Once this ability has been used, this terrain feature cannot use the 'Molten Blessing' abiity for the rest of the battle.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Offensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="6d7d-34f7-7f4d-29fa" name="Molten Blessing" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Start of Any Turn</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick a friendly **^^Fyreslayers Priest^^** within this terrain feature's combat range to be the target.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Add 1 to chanting rolls for the target for the rest of the turn. In addition, the target can use the 'Unbind' ability this turn as if it had **^^Wizard (1)^^**.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Offensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="ed70-f30-2f5a-747f" name="Ward Save" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">In step 1 of the damage sequence (see 18.0), make a **ward roll** of D6 for each **damage point** in this unit's **damage pool**. If the roll equals or exceeds this unit's **ward value**, remove that damage point from the damage pool.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile></profiles><categories><category id="cdd6-ffa1-9b32-4cb8" entryId="cdd6-ffa1-9b32-4cb8" name="FACTION TERRAIN" primary="true" /><category id="6a02-a995-fd92-d806" name="FYRESLAYERS" entryId="6a02-a995-fd92-d806" primary="false" /><category id="ee22-3575-6590-25c" name="ORDER" entryId="ee22-3575-6590-25c" primary="false" /><category id="70a4-383f-421f-52cd" name="WARD (6+)" entryId="70a4-383f-421f-52cd" primary="false" /></categories></selection></selections><costs><cost name="Force Category - GHB" typeId="de92-2099-fbf7-a156" value="1" /></costs><categories><category name="Configuration" id="evdgac" primary="false" entryId="676-2b78-7bbf-ba9c" /><category name="Reference" id="ev4d9o" primary="false" entryId="3360-1158-e879-9606" /><category name="Army Composition" id="wcpqan9" primary="false" entryId="ac97-b27c-7e35-7ab9" /><category name="FACTION TERRAIN" id="ev59wu" primary="false" entryId="cdd6-ffa1-9b32-4cb8" /><category name="Illegal Units" id="es7y4fm" primary="false" entryId="(Illegal Units)" /></categories><forces><force id="bu821s" name="Auxillary Units" entryId="6084-3baa-f00b-ac0a::8732-47c4-9f1c-e71e" catalogueId="b3f9-6c96-b99a-1e71" catalogueRevision="29" catalogueName="Fyreslayers"><selections><selection id="qa50o7f" name="Auric Flamekeeper" entryId="f59a-34cb-10c5-bc0d::4a5c-a6be-cecb-a47a" number="1" type="unit" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="2f1e-21e2-1563-2753" name="Auric Flamekeeper" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">4&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">5</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">5+</characteristic><characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">2</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="72bf-6539-c07a-6695" name="Masterflame Rune" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Turn (Army), Your Hero Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">If any friendly units have been destroyed during the battle, pick a friendly **^^Fyreslayers Infantry^^** unit wholly within 12&quot; of this unit to be the target.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Roll a dice. If the roll is equal to or less than the number of **^^Fyreslayers^^** units that have been destroyed during the battle, pick 1 of the following effects to apply until the start of your next turn:
***Grimnir's Grit:*** The target has **^^Ward (5+)^^**.
***Grimnir's Resolve:*** Add 2 to charge rolls for the target.
***Grimnir's Vengeance:*** Add 1 to the Damage characteristic of the target's melee weapons.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Special</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="3bc-444a-5cf8-e4d" name="Guarded Hero" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">If this **^^Hero^^** is within the combat range of a friendly unit that is not a **^^Hero^^**:
• Subtract 1 from hit rolls for shooting attacks that target this Hero.
• If this **^^Hero^^** is **^^Infantry^^**, they cannot be picked as the target of shooting attacks made by models more than 12&quot; from them.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="ed70-f30-2f5a-747f" name="Ward Save" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">In step 1 of the damage sequence (see 18.0), make a **ward roll** of D6 for each **damage point** in this unit's **damage pool**. If the roll equals or exceeds this unit's **ward value**, remove that damage point from the damage pool.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile></profiles><selections><selection id="qbgrok" name="Auric Flamekeeper" entryId="f59a-34cb-10c5-bc0d::e569-ac21-e3e7-5c7d" number="1" type="model" from="entry"><selections><selection id="qmpiusn" name="Brazier Axe" entryId="f59a-34cb-10c5-bc0d::f8e2-219-6975-8d9d" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="175b-e173-cf00-c48d" name="Brazier Axe" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">5</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">-</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection></selections></selection></selections><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="80" /></costs><categories><category id="6e72-1656-d554-528a" entryId="6e72-1656-d554-528a" name="HERO" primary="true" /><category id="ee22-3575-6590-25c" name="ORDER" entryId="ee22-3575-6590-25c" primary="false" /><category id="70a4-383f-421f-52cd" name="WARD (6+)" entryId="70a4-383f-421f-52cd" primary="false" /><category id="6a02-a995-fd92-d806" name="FYRESLAYERS" entryId="6a02-a995-fd92-d806" primary="false" /><category id="72e3-7b1b-cb94-4cbd" name="DUARDIN" entryId="72e3-7b1b-cb94-4cbd" primary="false" /><category id="75d6-6995-dfcc-3898" name="INFANTRY" entryId="75d6-6995-dfcc-3898" primary="false" /></categories></selection><selection id="quo8k6k" name="Auric Runefather" entryId="2755-f2b7-a10d-6f72::aa8-9db3-b817-6324" number="1" type="unit" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="eafd-cc37-9572-3afe" name="Auric Runefather" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">4&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">5</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">5+</characteristic><characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">2</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="ba46-feee-fe38-c2e1" name="Royal Retinue" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Battle (Army), Deployment Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick a friendly non-**^^Hero Fyreslayers Infantry^^** unit within this unit's combat range to be the royal retinue.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">For the rest of the battle, while the royal retinue is wholly within 6&quot; of this unit, add 1 to hit rolls for attacks made by the royal retinue and this unit has **^^Ward (4+)^^**.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="e38f-a659-a7d0-945f" name="Commanding Presence" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">End of Any Turn</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Add the current battle round number to the control scores of friendly **^^Fyreslayers Infantry^^** units wholly within 12&quot; of this unit for the rest of the turn.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Purple</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Control</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="3bc-444a-5cf8-e4d" name="Guarded Hero" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">If this **^^Hero^^** is within the combat range of a friendly unit that is not a **^^Hero^^**:
• Subtract 1 from hit rolls for shooting attacks that target this Hero.
• If this **^^Hero^^** is **^^Infantry^^**, they cannot be picked as the target of shooting attacks made by models more than 12&quot; from them.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="ed70-f30-2f5a-747f" name="Ward Save" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">In step 1 of the damage sequence (see 18.0), make a **ward roll** of D6 for each **damage point** in this unit's **damage pool**. If the roll equals or exceeds this unit's **ward value**, remove that damage point from the damage pool.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile></profiles><selections><selection id="qv4gdm4" name="Auric Runefather" entryId="2755-f2b7-a10d-6f72::a434-cf38-24dc-15b7" number="1" type="model" from="entry"><selections><selection id="qzt2vtb" name="Latchkey Grandaxe" entryId="2755-f2b7-a10d-6f72::f7bf-a1fb-4594-66e2" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="3d22-1daf-8d9d-2019" name="Latchkey Grandaxe" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">4</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">3</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">-</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection></selections></selection></selections><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="130" /></costs><categories><category id="6e72-1656-d554-528a" entryId="6e72-1656-d554-528a" name="HERO" primary="true" /><category id="ee22-3575-6590-25c" name="ORDER" entryId="ee22-3575-6590-25c" primary="false" /><category id="c203-51a0-3d44-6b07" name="WARMASTER" entryId="c203-51a0-3d44-6b07" primary="false" /><category id="70a4-383f-421f-52cd" name="WARD (6+)" entryId="70a4-383f-421f-52cd" primary="false" /><category id="6a02-a995-fd92-d806" name="FYRESLAYERS" entryId="6a02-a995-fd92-d806" primary="false" /><category id="72e3-7b1b-cb94-4cbd" name="DUARDIN" entryId="72e3-7b1b-cb94-4cbd" primary="false" /><category id="75d6-6995-dfcc-3898" name="INFANTRY" entryId="75d6-6995-dfcc-3898" primary="false" /></categories></selection><selection id="rb2rijm" name="Auric Runefather on Magmadroth" entryId="8555-7e4f-1473-773b::37e2-9685-abe9-bc10" number="1" type="unit" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="ba1a-f114-a619-d8a4" name="Auric Runefather on Magmadroth" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">10&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">14</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">5</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="7d91-4555-1f2e-bc64" name="Volcanic Blood" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">If you make an unmodified save roll of 1 for a combat attack that targets this unit, inflict 1 mortal damage on the attacking unit after the **^^Fight^^** ability has been resolved.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Red</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Offensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="c67d-fd63-a6a0-32b9" name="Warrior-kings" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Battle (Army), Your Combat Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">For the rest of the turn, add 1 to the Attacks characteristic of melee weapons used by friendly **^^Fyreslayers^^** units while they are wholly within 12&quot; of this unit.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Red</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Offensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="51b7-87f1-b470-cdac" name="Raging Inferno" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Turn (Army), Any Combat Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick an enemy unit in combat with this unit to be the target.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Roll a dice. On a 3+, subtract 1 from save rolls for the target for the rest of the turn.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f">**^^Rampage^^**</characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Red</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Offensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="6a3f-a7e8-b510-153a" name="Battle Damaged" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">While this unit has 10 or more damage points, the Attacks characteristic of its **Magmadroth's Claws and Horns** is 4.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Damage</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="ed70-f30-2f5a-747f" name="Ward Save" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">In step 1 of the damage sequence (see 18.0), make a **ward roll** of D6 for each **damage point** in this unit's **damage pool**. If the roll equals or exceeds this unit's **ward value**, remove that damage point from the damage pool.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile></profiles><selections><selection id="rcf54xb" name="Auric Runefather on Magmadroth" entryId="8555-7e4f-1473-773b::9946-f8ae-2717-9535" number="1" type="model" from="entry"><selections><selection id="rmbg59" name="Latchkey Grandaxe" entryId="8555-7e4f-1473-773b::daa4-2c9b-8b53-8da2" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="43b3-f23b-f4ef-dbfb" name="Latchkey Grandaxe" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">4</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">3</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">-</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection><selection id="rm83bcq" name="Magmadroth's Blazing Maw" entryId="8555-7e4f-1473-773b::a517-96fa-6414-a70f" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="40be-88bc-e21c-66c9" name="Magmadroth's Blazing Maw" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">2+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">3</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">Companion</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection><selection id="rms3pft" name="Magmadroth's Claws and Horns" entryId="8555-7e4f-1473-773b::fa86-6b2f-e277-6ca3" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="c0b5-3ea8-dbe3-f870" name="Magmadroth's Claws and Horns" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">6</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">2+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">Companion</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection><selection id="rm929x" name="Roaring Fyrestream" entryId="8555-7e4f-1473-773b::35b3-c5e-b8c1-7636" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="3635-d5d9-b374-1786" name="Roaring Fyrestream" hidden="false" typeId="1fd-a42f-41d3-fe05" typeName="Ranged Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Rng" typeId="c6b5-908c-a604-1a98">10&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="aa17-4296-2887-e05d">4</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="194d-aeb6-5ba7-83b4">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="d3d5-9dc6-13de-8d1">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="d03f-a9ae-3eec-755">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="96c2-d0a5-ea1e-653b">D3</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="d793-3dd7-9c13-741e">Anti‑**^^Infantry^^** (+1 Rend), Companion</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection></selections></selection></selections><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="320" /></costs><categories><category id="6e72-1656-d554-528a" entryId="6e72-1656-d554-528a" name="HERO" primary="true" /><category id="6d54-625c-d063-13e2" name="MONSTER" entryId="6d54-625c-d063-13e2" primary="false" /><category id="ee22-3575-6590-25c" name="ORDER" entryId="ee22-3575-6590-25c" primary="false" /><category id="c203-51a0-3d44-6b07" name="WARMASTER" entryId="c203-51a0-3d44-6b07" primary="false" /><category id="70a4-383f-421f-52cd" name="WARD (6+)" entryId="70a4-383f-421f-52cd" primary="false" /><category id="6a02-a995-fd92-d806" name="FYRESLAYERS" entryId="6a02-a995-fd92-d806" primary="false" /><category id="72e3-7b1b-cb94-4cbd" name="DUARDIN" entryId="72e3-7b1b-cb94-4cbd" primary="false" /><category id="2152-3158-ce97-4b6d" name="MAGMADROTH" entryId="2152-3158-ce97-4b6d" primary="false" /></categories></selection><selection id="rznu5kb" name="Auric Runemaster" entryId="1501-6e2e-8add-4a27::21bf-d0a3-f872-2def" number="1" type="unit" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="1db0-7b21-3764-1ef2" name="Auric Runemaster" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">4&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">5</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">5+</characteristic><characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">2</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="d2c0-668c-241a-8ff3" name="High Priest of the Zharrgrim" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">Each time a **^^Prayer^^** chanted by this unit is answered, this unit gains a **magmic power token**.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Special</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="1b2e-e8ec-e385-1318" name="Master of the Runes" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Reaction: You declared an **^^Ur-gold Rune^^** ability</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Remove 3 of this unit's **magmic power tokens**. If you do so, apply the effect below that corresponds to the **^^Ur-gold Rune^^** ability that was used:
***Rune of Fury:*** For the rest of the battle round, add 1 to wound rolls for combat attacks made by friendly **^^Fyreslayers^^** units while they have **^^Strike-first^^**.
***Rune of Fiery Determination:*** Add 1 to save rolls for friendly **^^Fyreslayers^^** units for the rest of the battle round.
***Rune of Relentless Zeal:*** Add 1 to run rolls and charge rolls for friendly **^^Fyreslayers^^** units for the rest of the battle round.
***Rune of Searing Heat:*** Add 1 to the Rend characteristic of melee weapons used by friendly **^^Fyreslayers^^** units for the rest of the battle round.
***Rune of Farsight:*** Increase the range of the 'Rune of Farsight' ability to 16&quot;.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Special</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="3bc-444a-5cf8-e4d" name="Guarded Hero" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">If this **^^Hero^^** is within the combat range of a friendly unit that is not a **^^Hero^^**:
• Subtract 1 from hit rolls for shooting attacks that target this Hero.
• If this **^^Hero^^** is **^^Infantry^^**, they cannot be picked as the target of shooting attacks made by models more than 12&quot; from them.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="ed70-f30-2f5a-747f" name="Ward Save" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">In step 1 of the damage sequence (see 18.0), make a **ward roll** of D6 for each **damage point** in this unit's **damage pool**. If the roll equals or exceeds this unit's **ward value**, remove that damage point from the damage pool.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile></profiles><selections><selection id="s03qeui" name="Auric Runemaster" entryId="1501-6e2e-8add-4a27::cda1-b920-2c10-9461" number="1" type="model" from="entry"><selections><selection id="s6rb0i" name="Brazier Staff" entryId="1501-6e2e-8add-4a27::6e0c-539-ec01-a276" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="983f-d6c3-7777-108a" name="Brazier Staff" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">3</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">-</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection></selections></selection></selections><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="160" /></costs><categories><category id="6e72-1656-d554-528a" entryId="6e72-1656-d554-528a" name="HERO" primary="true" /><category id="ee22-3575-6590-25c" name="ORDER" entryId="ee22-3575-6590-25c" primary="false" /><category id="70a4-383f-421f-52cd" name="WARD (6+)" entryId="70a4-383f-421f-52cd" primary="false" /><category id="6a02-a995-fd92-d806" name="FYRESLAYERS" entryId="6a02-a995-fd92-d806" primary="false" /><category id="72e3-7b1b-cb94-4cbd" name="DUARDIN" entryId="72e3-7b1b-cb94-4cbd" primary="false" /><category id="75d6-6995-dfcc-3898" name="INFANTRY" entryId="75d6-6995-dfcc-3898" primary="false" /><category id="e692-853d-6db8-fdbe" name="PRIEST (2)" entryId="e692-853d-6db8-fdbe" primary="false" /></categories></selection><selection id="sf9lzxr" name="Auric Runesmiter" entryId="b43b-26d7-ed19-4112::7b03-4613-6b5b-a9ce" number="1" type="unit" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="3df4-ea4-3618-24c8" name="Auric Runesmiter" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">4&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">5</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">5+</characteristic><characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">2</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="c8ea-6a90-69a0-5c09" name="Emergence" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Your Hero Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick this unit if it is **underground**.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Set up this unit anywhere on the battlefield more than 9&quot; from all enemy units. Then, set up the other unit that was set up **underground** with it (if any) wholly within 6&quot; of this unit and more than 9&quot; from all enemy units.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Movement</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="c370-d3c5-7aa-1f31" name="Magmic Tunnelling" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Deployment Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick this unit and any number of other units in its regiment if none of those units have been deployed.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Set up those units in reserve **underground**. They have now been deployed.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f">**^^Deploy^^**</characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Special</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="3bc-444a-5cf8-e4d" name="Guarded Hero" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">If this **^^Hero^^** is within the combat range of a friendly unit that is not a **^^Hero^^**:
• Subtract 1 from hit rolls for shooting attacks that target this Hero.
• If this **^^Hero^^** is **^^Infantry^^**, they cannot be picked as the target of shooting attacks made by models more than 12&quot; from them.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="ed70-f30-2f5a-747f" name="Ward Save" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">In step 1 of the damage sequence (see 18.0), make a **ward roll** of D6 for each **damage point** in this unit's **damage pool**. If the roll equals or exceeds this unit's **ward value**, remove that damage point from the damage pool.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile></profiles><selections><selection id="sfegmcb" name="Auric Runesmiter" entryId="b43b-26d7-ed19-4112::d96d-e7ba-362d-73ee" number="1" type="model" from="entry"><selections><selection id="skllm1" name="Latch-axe" entryId="b43b-26d7-ed19-4112::3909-d6f1-93a-9ab7" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="dba4-7280-f235-4c3b" name="Latch-axe" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">4</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">-</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection></selections></selection></selections><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="90" /></costs><categories><category id="6e72-1656-d554-528a" entryId="6e72-1656-d554-528a" name="HERO" primary="true" /><category id="ee22-3575-6590-25c" name="ORDER" entryId="ee22-3575-6590-25c" primary="false" /><category id="70a4-383f-421f-52cd" name="WARD (6+)" entryId="70a4-383f-421f-52cd" primary="false" /><category id="6a02-a995-fd92-d806" name="FYRESLAYERS" entryId="6a02-a995-fd92-d806" primary="false" /><category id="72e3-7b1b-cb94-4cbd" name="DUARDIN" entryId="72e3-7b1b-cb94-4cbd" primary="false" /><category id="75d6-6995-dfcc-3898" name="INFANTRY" entryId="75d6-6995-dfcc-3898" primary="false" /><category id="3fe-84f4-cec6-a1c1" name="PRIEST (1)" entryId="3fe-84f4-cec6-a1c1" primary="false" /></categories></selection><selection id="t13gtp8" name="Auric Runesmiter on Magmadroth" entryId="62ce-aee7-f634-c624::268e-676d-c731-7d26" number="1" type="unit" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="6529-f516-5d3d-626" name="Auric Runesmiter on Magmadroth" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">10&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">14</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">5</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="3156-3534-cfe6-8c1f" name="Volcanic Blood" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">If you make an unmodified save roll of 1 for a combat attack that targets this unit, inflict 1 mortal damage on the attacking unit after the **^^Fight^^** ability has been resolved.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Red</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Offensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="376f-7c6d-e7c6-cd25" name="Runic Empowerment" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Your Hero Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick a friendly **^^Fyreslayers^^** unit wholly within 12&quot; of this unit to be the target.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Roll a dice. On a 3+, add 1 to wound rolls for the target's attacks for the rest of the turn.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Offensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="e5ec-9eae-f2a8-de4e" name="Lashing Tail" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Turn (Army), Any Combat Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick an enemy unit in combat with this unit to be the target.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Roll 2D6. If the roll is equal to or less than the number of models in the target unit, inflict D3+3 mortal damage on the target.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f">**^^Rampage^^**</characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Red</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Offensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="5162-9f4c-6746-f1f5" name="Battle Damaged" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">While this unit has 10 or more damage points, the Attacks characteristic of its **Magmadroth's Claws and Horns** is 4.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Damage</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="ed70-f30-2f5a-747f" name="Ward Save" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">In step 1 of the damage sequence (see 18.0), make a **ward roll** of D6 for each **damage point** in this unit's **damage pool**. If the roll equals or exceeds this unit's **ward value**, remove that damage point from the damage pool.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile></profiles><selections><selection id="t3zt6n" name="Auric Runesmiter on Magmadroth" entryId="62ce-aee7-f634-c624::80d0-4144-5e69-7e19" number="1" type="model" from="entry"><selections><selection id="tcwyt5i" name="Latch-axe" entryId="62ce-aee7-f634-c624::472d-39d9-2a4c-32dc" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="83d7-e4be-aeb9-1a30" name="Latch-axe" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">4</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">-</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection><selection id="tc3ktti" name="Magmadroth's Blazing Maw" entryId="62ce-aee7-f634-c624::157c-9563-cfb0-22dc" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="cf81-1b99-932e-96ee" name="Magmadroth's Blazing Maw" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">2+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">3</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">Companion</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection><selection id="tcgkuxo" name="Magmadroth's Claws and Horns" entryId="62ce-aee7-f634-c624::e9b0-dc04-7e98-a751" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="4457-f1d4-a498-5ef9" name="Magmadroth's Claws and Horns" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">6</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">2+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">Companion</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection><selection id="tc3cs3x" name="Roaring Fyrestream" entryId="62ce-aee7-f634-c624::1db8-ccb8-5414-c801" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="cc76-63a4-1966-c8d3" name="Roaring Fyrestream" hidden="false" typeId="1fd-a42f-41d3-fe05" typeName="Ranged Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Rng" typeId="c6b5-908c-a604-1a98">10&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="aa17-4296-2887-e05d">4</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="194d-aeb6-5ba7-83b4">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="d3d5-9dc6-13de-8d1">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="d03f-a9ae-3eec-755">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="96c2-d0a5-ea1e-653b">D3</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="d793-3dd7-9c13-741e">Anti‑**^^Infantry^^** (+1 Rend), Companion</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection></selections></selection></selections><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="280" /></costs><categories><category id="6e72-1656-d554-528a" entryId="6e72-1656-d554-528a" name="HERO" primary="true" /><category id="6d54-625c-d063-13e2" name="MONSTER" entryId="6d54-625c-d063-13e2" primary="false" /><category id="ee22-3575-6590-25c" name="ORDER" entryId="ee22-3575-6590-25c" primary="false" /><category id="70a4-383f-421f-52cd" name="WARD (6+)" entryId="70a4-383f-421f-52cd" primary="false" /><category id="6a02-a995-fd92-d806" name="FYRESLAYERS" entryId="6a02-a995-fd92-d806" primary="false" /><category id="72e3-7b1b-cb94-4cbd" name="DUARDIN" entryId="72e3-7b1b-cb94-4cbd" primary="false" /><category id="2152-3158-ce97-4b6d" name="MAGMADROTH" entryId="2152-3158-ce97-4b6d" primary="false" /><category id="3fe-84f4-cec6-a1c1" name="PRIEST (1)" entryId="3fe-84f4-cec6-a1c1" primary="false" /></categories></selection><selection id="tuhk8t" name="Auric Runeson" entryId="76f1-1add-e9e9-82a4::94e6-d5d5-c8e6-7282" number="1" type="unit" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="63e4-4d1-bfc9-dc95" name="Auric Runeson" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">4&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">5</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">5+</characteristic><characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">2</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="f66a-bf06-54dd-eaab" name="Fearless Charge" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">If this unit charged this turn, for the rest of the turn, add 1 to charge rolls for friendly **^^Fyreslayers Infantry^^** units while they are wholly within 18&quot; of this unit.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Orange</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Movement</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="8f6-b319-e55b-e72c" name="Dauntless Assault" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Reaction: You declared a **^^Fight^^** ability for this unit</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Pick a friendly non-**^^Hero Fyreslayers Infantry^^** unit that has not used a **^^Fight^^** ability this turn and is within this unit's combat range to be the target. The target can be picked to use a **^^Fight^^** ability immediately after the **^^Fight^^** ability used by this unit has been resolved.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Red</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Offensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="3bc-444a-5cf8-e4d" name="Guarded Hero" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">If this **^^Hero^^** is within the combat range of a friendly unit that is not a **^^Hero^^**:
• Subtract 1 from hit rolls for shooting attacks that target this Hero.
• If this **^^Hero^^** is **^^Infantry^^**, they cannot be picked as the target of shooting attacks made by models more than 12&quot; from them.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="ed70-f30-2f5a-747f" name="Ward Save" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">In step 1 of the damage sequence (see 18.0), make a **ward roll** of D6 for each **damage point** in this unit's **damage pool**. If the roll equals or exceeds this unit's **ward value**, remove that damage point from the damage pool.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile></profiles><selections><selection id="tuhdzt" name="Auric Runeson" entryId="76f1-1add-e9e9-82a4::4706-cfbc-b81f-33b9" number="1" type="model" from="entry"><selections><selection id="u4y9kc" name="Ancestral Weapons" entryId="76f1-1add-e9e9-82a4::901f-816b-d5f8-cacb" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="2f93-2f24-3b71-4ad8" name="Ancestral Weapons" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">5</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">Anti‑**^^Monster^^** (+1 Rend)</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection></selections></selection></selections><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="90" /></costs><categories><category id="6e72-1656-d554-528a" entryId="6e72-1656-d554-528a" name="HERO" primary="true" /><category id="ee22-3575-6590-25c" name="ORDER" entryId="ee22-3575-6590-25c" primary="false" /><category id="70a4-383f-421f-52cd" name="WARD (6+)" entryId="70a4-383f-421f-52cd" primary="false" /><category id="6a02-a995-fd92-d806" name="FYRESLAYERS" entryId="6a02-a995-fd92-d806" primary="false" /><category id="72e3-7b1b-cb94-4cbd" name="DUARDIN" entryId="72e3-7b1b-cb94-4cbd" primary="false" /><category id="75d6-6995-dfcc-3898" name="INFANTRY" entryId="75d6-6995-dfcc-3898" primary="false" /></categories></selection><selection id="uif7ot" name="Auric Runeson on Magmadroth" entryId="6b46-175e-db91-5802::de0d-34a7-ac61-53de" number="1" type="unit" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="65b5-fca3-bf4a-4497" name="Auric Runeson on Magmadroth" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">10&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">14</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">5</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="8856-c927-3f44-83b" name="Volcanic Blood" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">If you make an unmodified save roll of 1 for a combat attack that targets this unit, inflict 1 mortal damage on the attacking unit after the **^^Fight^^** ability has been resolved.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Red</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Offensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="42ec-909f-19c6-c41f" name="Battle Damaged" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">While this unit has 10 or more damage points, the Attacks characteristic of its **Magmadroth's Claws and Horns** is 4.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Damage</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="1c8e-61d2-9788-c7db" name="Dominating Roar" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Turn (Army), End of Any Turn</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick an enemy **^^Monster^^** in combat with this unit to be the target.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">If this unit has fewer damage points than the target, subtract 10 from the target's control score for the rest of the turn.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f">**^^Rampage^^**</characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Purple</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Control</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="9310-2dd1-ffd9-39f4" name="Vying for Glory" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">Each time this unit destroys a **^^Monster^^**, add 1 to the Attacks characteristic of this unit's **Ancestral Weapons** for the rest of the battle. This unit can be affected by this ability multiple times and the effects are cumulative.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Red</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Offensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="ed70-f30-2f5a-747f" name="Ward Save" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">In step 1 of the damage sequence (see 18.0), make a **ward roll** of D6 for each **damage point** in this unit's **damage pool**. If the roll equals or exceeds this unit's **ward value**, remove that damage point from the damage pool.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile></profiles><selections><selection id="ujd0t4m" name="Auric Runeson on Magmadroth" entryId="6b46-175e-db91-5802::5f94-db21-96ed-b75d" number="1" type="model" from="entry"><selections><selection id="uu3tuwg" name="Ancestral Weapons" entryId="6b46-175e-db91-5802::9341-9ae5-616c-6e78" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="8681-f0f1-1dd6-c521" name="Ancestral Weapons" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">5</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">Anti‑**^^Monster^^** (+1 Rend)</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection><selection id="uuxv5fc" name="Magmadroth's Blazing Maw" entryId="6b46-175e-db91-5802::3d3c-11f9-17c-c5f4" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="7e63-b1df-cd6b-8813" name="Magmadroth's Blazing Maw" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">2+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">3</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">Companion</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection><selection id="uut9tbp" name="Magmadroth's Claws and Horns" entryId="6b46-175e-db91-5802::e1b3-47e7-a903-aeef" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="303d-9e40-fc98-3b44" name="Magmadroth's Claws and Horns" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">6</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">2+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">Companion</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection><selection id="uup5zzv" name="Roaring Fyrestream" entryId="6b46-175e-db91-5802::93a1-c14e-a481-448a" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="96b0-5ce0-6856-3721" name="Roaring Fyrestream" hidden="false" typeId="1fd-a42f-41d3-fe05" typeName="Ranged Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Rng" typeId="c6b5-908c-a604-1a98">10&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="aa17-4296-2887-e05d">4</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="194d-aeb6-5ba7-83b4">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="d3d5-9dc6-13de-8d1">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="d03f-a9ae-3eec-755">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="96c2-d0a5-ea1e-653b">D3</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="d793-3dd7-9c13-741e">Anti‑**^^Infantry^^** (+1 Rend), Companion</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection></selections></selection></selections><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="240" /></costs><categories><category id="6e72-1656-d554-528a" entryId="6e72-1656-d554-528a" name="HERO" primary="true" /><category id="6d54-625c-d063-13e2" name="MONSTER" entryId="6d54-625c-d063-13e2" primary="false" /><category id="ee22-3575-6590-25c" name="ORDER" entryId="ee22-3575-6590-25c" primary="false" /><category id="70a4-383f-421f-52cd" name="WARD (6+)" entryId="70a4-383f-421f-52cd" primary="false" /><category id="6a02-a995-fd92-d806" name="FYRESLAYERS" entryId="6a02-a995-fd92-d806" primary="false" /><category id="72e3-7b1b-cb94-4cbd" name="DUARDIN" entryId="72e3-7b1b-cb94-4cbd" primary="false" /><category id="2152-3158-ce97-4b6d" name="MAGMADROTH" entryId="2152-3158-ce97-4b6d" primary="false" /></categories></selection><selection id="mbd995f" name="Auric Runeson on Magmadroth (Scourge of Aqshy)" entryId="40bd-ac32-e08c-6819::d7ea-c712-766e-4585" number="1" type="unit" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="83da-4dfc-9a19-c0d0" name="Auric Runeson on Magmadroth" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">10&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">14</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">5</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="a324-1b5c-c4cb-bd2d" name="Volcanic Blood" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">Each time you make an unmodified save roll of 1 for a combat attack that targets this unit, inflict 1 mortal damage on the attacking unit after the **^^Fight^^** ability has been resolved.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Red</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Offensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="a296-9f7c-4b85-a2ca" name="Battle Damaged" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">While this unit has 10 or more damage points, the Attacks characteristic of its **Magmadroth's Claws and Horns** is 4.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Damage</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="f15a-2a66-9a1d-0d99" name="Fire, Blood and Vengeance" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Deployment Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick a friendly **Auric Runefather on Magmadroth** on the battlefield to be the target.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Add 1 to the Damage characteristic of this unit's melee weapons, including **Companion** weapons, while the target is in combat, damaged or destroyed.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Offensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="52ad-114c-4fce-9ada" name="Seeing Red" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Turn (Army), Any Combat Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Spend 1 **rage dice**. If your opponent's **fury level** is lower than yours, they must increase their **fury level** by 1, to a maximum of 7. Then, pick 1 of the following effects:
***Channelled Ire*:** Add 1 to the Attacks characteristic of this unit's **Companion** melee weapons for the rest of the turn.
***Cathartic Release*:** Roll a number of dice equal to your fury level. For each 4+, **Heal (1)** this unit.
***Shield of Anger*:** This unit has **^^Ward (5+)^^** for the rest of the turn.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f">**^^Rampage^^**</characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Red</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Special</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="ed70-f30-2f5a-747f" name="Ward Save" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">In step 1 of the damage sequence (see 18.0), make a **ward roll** of D6 for each **damage point** in this unit's **damage pool**. If the roll equals or exceeds this unit's **ward value**, remove that damage point from the damage pool.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile></profiles><selections><selection id="mc3f45m" name="Auric Runeson on Magmadroth" entryId="40bd-ac32-e08c-6819::37a1-b10c-8e45-83a8" number="1" type="model" from="entry"><selections><selection id="mjokrsa" name="Ancestral Weapons" entryId="40bd-ac32-e08c-6819::4e60-22d3-ab30-438b" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="a345-dda1-f21c-1a94" name="Ancestral Weapons" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">5</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">Anti‑**^^Monster^^** (+1 Rend)</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection><selection id="mjpcfy" name="Magmadroth's Blazing Maw" entryId="40bd-ac32-e08c-6819::7d2f-b2fa-fd9c-b6cd" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="ca0d-71f5-fc19-9f27" name="Magmadroth's Blazing Maw" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">2+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">3</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">Companion</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection><selection id="mjxrew8" name="Magmadroth's Claws and Horns" entryId="40bd-ac32-e08c-6819::c8f9-73c8-e2b8-bbf8" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="41ae-104e-d12d-66b0" name="Magmadroth's Claws and Horns" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">6</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">2+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">Companion</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection><selection id="mj504su" name="Roaring Fyrestream" entryId="40bd-ac32-e08c-6819::78f0-cd5b-da49-9b1d" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="882f-cf93-7dd6-1f32" name="Roaring Fyrestream" hidden="false" typeId="1fd-a42f-41d3-fe05" typeName="Ranged Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Rng" typeId="c6b5-908c-a604-1a98">10&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="aa17-4296-2887-e05d">4</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="194d-aeb6-5ba7-83b4">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="d3d5-9dc6-13de-8d1">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="d03f-a9ae-3eec-755">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="96c2-d0a5-ea1e-653b">D3</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="d793-3dd7-9c13-741e">Anti‑**^^Infantry^^** (+1 Rend), Companion</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection></selections></selection></selections><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="330" /></costs><categories><category id="6e72-1656-d554-528a" entryId="6e72-1656-d554-528a" name="HERO" primary="true" /><category id="6d54-625c-d063-13e2" name="MONSTER" entryId="6d54-625c-d063-13e2" primary="false" /><category id="ee22-3575-6590-25c" name="ORDER" entryId="ee22-3575-6590-25c" primary="false" /><category id="70a4-383f-421f-52cd" name="WARD (6+)" entryId="70a4-383f-421f-52cd" primary="false" /><category id="6a02-a995-fd92-d806" name="FYRESLAYERS" entryId="6a02-a995-fd92-d806" primary="false" /><category id="72e3-7b1b-cb94-4cbd" name="DUARDIN" entryId="72e3-7b1b-cb94-4cbd" primary="false" /><category id="2152-3158-ce97-4b6d" name="MAGMADROTH" entryId="2152-3158-ce97-4b6d" primary="false" /></categories></selection><selection id="mtx2rud" name="Battlesmith" entryId="a34e-1395-e80e-dd6b::eb16-2bd1-6982-c82d" number="1" type="unit" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="2db9-61a0-3da8-4d8f" name="Battlesmith" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">4&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">5</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">5+</characteristic><characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">5</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="68b9-380a-b47a-9d9c" name="Icon of Grimnir" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">Ignore negative modifiers to the control scores of friendly **^^Fyreslayers^^** units while they are wholly within 12&quot; of this unit.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Purple</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Control</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="7c8f-5efb-a5ba-b3ed" name="Bard of the Lodge" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">If a friendly unit wholly within 12&quot; of this unit uses the 'Rally' command, you can make 3 additional rally rolls of D6.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Rallying</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="3bc-444a-5cf8-e4d" name="Guarded Hero" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">If this **^^Hero^^** is within the combat range of a friendly unit that is not a **^^Hero^^**:
• Subtract 1 from hit rolls for shooting attacks that target this Hero.
• If this **^^Hero^^** is **^^Infantry^^**, they cannot be picked as the target of shooting attacks made by models more than 12&quot; from them.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="ed70-f30-2f5a-747f" name="Ward Save" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">In step 1 of the damage sequence (see 18.0), make a **ward roll** of D6 for each **damage point** in this unit's **damage pool**. If the roll equals or exceeds this unit's **ward value**, remove that damage point from the damage pool.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile></profiles><selections><selection id="muhk0i" name="Battlesmith" entryId="a34e-1395-e80e-dd6b::ac10-40d-59c2-305a" number="1" type="model" from="entry"><selections><selection id="n03fkhl" name="Ancestral Battle-axe" entryId="a34e-1395-e80e-dd6b::c064-d8b4-4be8-43d3" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="871c-6585-9032-3f2a" name="Ancestral Battle-axe" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">5</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">-</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection></selections></selection></selections><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="100" /></costs><categories><category id="6e72-1656-d554-528a" entryId="6e72-1656-d554-528a" name="HERO" primary="true" /><category id="ee22-3575-6590-25c" name="ORDER" entryId="ee22-3575-6590-25c" primary="false" /><category id="70a4-383f-421f-52cd" name="WARD (6+)" entryId="70a4-383f-421f-52cd" primary="false" /><category id="6a02-a995-fd92-d806" name="FYRESLAYERS" entryId="6a02-a995-fd92-d806" primary="false" /><category id="72e3-7b1b-cb94-4cbd" name="DUARDIN" entryId="72e3-7b1b-cb94-4cbd" primary="false" /><category id="75d6-6995-dfcc-3898" name="INFANTRY" entryId="75d6-6995-dfcc-3898" primary="false" /></categories></selection><selection id="nazopve" name="Doomseeker" entryId="b89-9c2a-22ea-4fdd::2a37-8d73-b1ba-576d" number="1" type="unit" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="9895-8541-54fc-4792" name="Doomseeker" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">4&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">5</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">5+</characteristic><characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">2</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="b3c-5830-c106-a575" name="Runic Power" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">Add 1 to the Damage characteristic of this unit's melee weapons while this unit has 1 damage point. Add 2 to the Damage characteristic of this unit's melee weapons instead while this unit has 2 or more damage points.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Red</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Offensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="1ba4-6803-e5a4-232c" name="Oathbound" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Deployment Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick an enemy unit to be this unit's quarry. You can pick a unit that has been deployed in reserve.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Add 1 to hit rolls and wound rolls for attacks made by this unit that target its quarry. 
If this unit is destroyed while it is in combat with its quarry, inflict 3 mortal damage on this unit's quarry immediately after the ability that destroyed this unit has been resolved.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Special</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="3bc-444a-5cf8-e4d" name="Guarded Hero" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">If this **^^Hero^^** is within the combat range of a friendly unit that is not a **^^Hero^^**:
• Subtract 1 from hit rolls for shooting attacks that target this Hero.
• If this **^^Hero^^** is **^^Infantry^^**, they cannot be picked as the target of shooting attacks made by models more than 12&quot; from them.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="ed70-f30-2f5a-747f" name="Ward Save" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">In step 1 of the damage sequence (see 18.0), make a **ward roll** of D6 for each **damage point** in this unit's **damage pool**. If the roll equals or exceeds this unit's **ward value**, remove that damage point from the damage pool.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile></profiles><selections><selection id="naktvgl" name="Doomseeker" entryId="b89-9c2a-22ea-4fdd::c873-39f5-73f7-f3fa" number="1" type="model" from="entry"><selections><selection id="negtv0k" name="Doomseeker Weapons" entryId="b89-9c2a-22ea-4fdd::adcc-b06c-94ab-5d59" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="d867-e11f-5e48-1de6" name="Doomseeker Weapons" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">5</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">-</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection></selections></selection></selections><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="80" /></costs><categories><category id="6e72-1656-d554-528a" entryId="6e72-1656-d554-528a" name="HERO" primary="true" /><category id="ee22-3575-6590-25c" name="ORDER" entryId="ee22-3575-6590-25c" primary="false" /><category id="70a4-383f-421f-52cd" name="WARD (6+)" entryId="70a4-383f-421f-52cd" primary="false" /><category id="6a02-a995-fd92-d806" name="FYRESLAYERS" entryId="6a02-a995-fd92-d806" primary="false" /><category id="72e3-7b1b-cb94-4cbd" name="DUARDIN" entryId="72e3-7b1b-cb94-4cbd" primary="false" /><category id="75d6-6995-dfcc-3898" name="INFANTRY" entryId="75d6-6995-dfcc-3898" primary="false" /></categories></selection><selection id="nptwrx8" name="Grimhold Exile" entryId="19b2-f461-196e-4992::145f-e68f-3a4e-c25a" number="1" type="unit" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="e874-66da-a26b-2612" name="Grimhold Exile" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">4&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">6</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">5+</characteristic><characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">2</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="c0aa-e32f-bf45-9a98" name="Honour to Grimnir!" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Battle, Your Hero Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick up to 3 friendly **^^Fyreslayers Infantry^^** units wholly within 12&quot; of this unit to be the targets.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">You can re-roll charge rolls for the targets for the rest of the turn.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Movement</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="41c5-88ba-a063-30eb" name="Last of the Lodge-fire" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Battle, Any Combat Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick an enemy unit in combat with this unit to be the target.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Roll a number of dice equal to the target's Health characteristic. For each 4+, inflict 1 mortal damage on the target.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f">**^^Core^^**, **^^Attack^^**, **^^Fight^^**</characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Special</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="3bc-444a-5cf8-e4d" name="Guarded Hero" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">If this **^^Hero^^** is within the combat range of a friendly unit that is not a **^^Hero^^**:
• Subtract 1 from hit rolls for shooting attacks that target this Hero.
• If this **^^Hero^^** is **^^Infantry^^**, they cannot be picked as the target of shooting attacks made by models more than 12&quot; from them.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="ed70-f30-2f5a-747f" name="Ward Save" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">In step 1 of the damage sequence (see 18.0), make a **ward roll** of D6 for each **damage point** in this unit's **damage pool**. If the roll equals or exceeds this unit's **ward value**, remove that damage point from the damage pool.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile></profiles><selections><selection id="npnpkqn" name="Grimhold Exile" entryId="19b2-f461-196e-4992::5e78-b19f-f426-d676" number="1" type="model" from="entry"><selections><selection id="ntfjv2" name="Fyre-rune Hammers" entryId="19b2-f461-196e-4992::8e84-3eb6-a35b-6aea" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="20a1-7558-52be-497c" name="Fyre-rune Hammers" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">5</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">-</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection></selections></selection></selections><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="90" /></costs><categories><category id="6e72-1656-d554-528a" entryId="6e72-1656-d554-528a" name="HERO" primary="true" /><category id="ee22-3575-6590-25c" name="ORDER" entryId="ee22-3575-6590-25c" primary="false" /><category id="70a4-383f-421f-52cd" name="WARD (6+)" entryId="70a4-383f-421f-52cd" primary="false" /><category id="6a02-a995-fd92-d806" name="FYRESLAYERS" entryId="6a02-a995-fd92-d806" primary="false" /><category id="72e3-7b1b-cb94-4cbd" name="DUARDIN" entryId="72e3-7b1b-cb94-4cbd" primary="false" /><category id="75d6-6995-dfcc-3898" name="INFANTRY" entryId="75d6-6995-dfcc-3898" primary="false" /></categories></selection><selection id="o53l1ke" name="Grimwrath Berzerker" entryId="6443-bbfe-4967-5fd4::1b3c-edf1-cb89-c9" number="1" type="unit" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="c6e6-d289-4915-119b" name="Grimwrath Berzerker" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">4&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">5</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">5+</characteristic><characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">2</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="4915-7c6c-f457-d0bc" name="Grimwrath Oaths" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Deployment Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Pick 1 of the following oaths for this unit to swear:
***'I will guard them with my life!':*** While this unit is wholly within 6&quot; of another friendly **^^Fyreslayers Hero^^**:
• Add 1 to hit rolls for this unit's attacks.
• Add 1 to ward rolls for this unit.
If a friendly **^^Fyreslayers Hero^^** wholly within 6&quot; of this unit is destroyed, this effect no longer applies.
***'I will not be stopped!':*** Add 1 to charge rolls for this unit, and add 1 to save rolls for this unit while it is in combat. If this unit uses the 'Retreat' or 'Rally' abilities, this effect no longer applies.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Special</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="7dca-675a-fae2-16f8" name="Battle-fury" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Battle, Any Combat Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">If this unit is in combat, it can use 2 **^^Fight^^** abilities this phase. After the first is used, however, this unit has **^^Strike-last^^** for the rest of the phase.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Red</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Offensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="3bc-444a-5cf8-e4d" name="Guarded Hero" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">If this **^^Hero^^** is within the combat range of a friendly unit that is not a **^^Hero^^**:
• Subtract 1 from hit rolls for shooting attacks that target this Hero.
• If this **^^Hero^^** is **^^Infantry^^**, they cannot be picked as the target of shooting attacks made by models more than 12&quot; from them.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="ed70-f30-2f5a-747f" name="Ward Save" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">In step 1 of the damage sequence (see 18.0), make a **ward roll** of D6 for each **damage point** in this unit's **damage pool**. If the roll equals or exceeds this unit's **ward value**, remove that damage point from the damage pool.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile></profiles><selections><selection id="o6xurdd" name="Grimwrath Berzerker" entryId="6443-bbfe-4967-5fd4::b551-cf82-cd6a-9793" number="1" type="model" from="entry"><selections><selection id="oae2vmo" name="Fyrestorm Greataxe" entryId="6443-bbfe-4967-5fd4::74d8-5a7-86f3-2413" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="a66-83c7-a677-fa4b" name="Fyrestorm Greataxe" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">5</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">-</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection></selections></selection></selections><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="110" /></costs><categories><category id="6e72-1656-d554-528a" entryId="6e72-1656-d554-528a" name="HERO" primary="true" /><category id="ee22-3575-6590-25c" name="ORDER" entryId="ee22-3575-6590-25c" primary="false" /><category id="70a4-383f-421f-52cd" name="WARD (6+)" entryId="70a4-383f-421f-52cd" primary="false" /><category id="6a02-a995-fd92-d806" name="FYRESLAYERS" entryId="6a02-a995-fd92-d806" primary="false" /><category id="72e3-7b1b-cb94-4cbd" name="DUARDIN" entryId="72e3-7b1b-cb94-4cbd" primary="false" /><category id="75d6-6995-dfcc-3898" name="INFANTRY" entryId="75d6-6995-dfcc-3898" primary="false" /></categories></selection><selection id="okg3be" name="Auric Hearthguard" entryId="d1af-898a-68a4-d074::c2d0-1db-e516-2344" number="1" type="unit" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="33ca-3418-98b5-60a7" name="Auric Hearthguard" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">4&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">6+</characteristic><characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">1</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="ae23-a3a5-8c15-12cb" name="Molten Rockbolts" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">Each time a shooting attack made by this unit scores a critical hit, subtract 1&quot; from the target unit's Move characteristic until the start of your next turn. This ability cannot reduce the target unit's unmodified Move characteristic below half</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Blue</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Movement</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="ed70-f30-2f5a-747f" name="Ward Save" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">In step 1 of the damage sequence (see 18.0), make a **ward roll** of D6 for each **damage point** in this unit's **damage pool**. If the roll equals or exceeds this unit's **ward value**, remove that damage point from the damage pool.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile></profiles><selections><selection id="omtwtu" name="Auric Hearthguard" entryId="d1af-898a-68a4-d074::a968-db0-69a-93c2" number="1" type="model" from="entry"><selections><selection id="on3mwjn" name="Magmapike" entryId="d1af-898a-68a4-d074::ad85-3aef-c6c6-be56" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="5661-8ee4-9085-5e5d" name="Magmapike" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">1</characteristic><cha